# Agent-Docs Session Memory

The agent must use the `./agent-docs/` folder as persistent project memory.

Important project state, implementation decisions, debugging discoveries, setup notes, and unresolved issues must be documented there so future sessions can continue without rediscovering the same context.

## Core Rule

When the agent learns something useful about the project that should survive beyond the current chat session, it must write or update a note inside `./agent-docs/`.

The agent must not rely only on chat history for important project context.

## Required Folder

The project must contain:

```txt
./agent-docs/